ganisation to save the tavern and become its rightful owner. Otherwise the lord of the city of Ignacia will get all the rights to this tavern to compensate the debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576330/extras/24ca5365eadb1296553573e118713d5b.avif?t=1759135045\" width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will have to fight the dungeon monsters and get resources for tavern\u2019s development. For this you will be able to upgrade your skills and abilities, as well as craft the weapons. In the tavern you will find a mini-game in which you will cook for your clients using the products from the dungeon. Apart from that you will meet 6 lovely girls in the game and will be able to develop relationships with them. Complete their tasks and you will be well rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576330/extras/8a1a2e1ea2072a970d7f920ad8e5ac7b.avif?t=1759135045\" width=800 height=243 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multi-level dungeon system consisting of 100 levels and 10 bosses in between them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrading skills, weapons and abilities of the hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crafting weapons and making magical items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >trading (with a trader)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mini-games in which you\u2019ll create weapons and cook for the tavern\u2019s clients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to change tavern\u2019s interior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >developing relationships with 6 lovely girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 \u201cbed\u201d scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph